      "side": 1,
      "message": "This works, but you\u0027ll get cache invalidations for *any* account update, not just tokens. Better would be to check the blob object-id of the `tokens.config` file (`VersionedAuthTokens`), if it exists, and use that in the key. There\u0027s a protected `getObjectId(filename)` method already in `VersionedMetaData` that does that lookup for you. You can see it used in [`ProjectConfig`](https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/changes/85/634885/4/java/com/google/gerrit/server/project/ProjectConfig.java#705).\n\nWith that improvement, you might even want to switch this to a persisted cache, but we can always do that later too.",
